Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:30.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.91,0:31:35.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(去你妈的)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.68,0:41:42.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:31.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:46.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's okay. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:49.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下 快扔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it down. Drop it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:53.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是史蒂文·爱德华兹医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dr. Steven Edwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:56.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是道恩·勒纳警官 你感觉怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Officer Dawn Lerner. How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:57.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:00.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚特兰大的格拉迪纪念医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grady Memorial Hospital in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:03.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么到这里来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的警官在路边发现了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My officers found you on the side of the road
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被一群行尸围住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surrounded by rotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:07.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手腕骨折了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wrist was fractured
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头部受了轻伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you sustained a superficial head wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:11.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能记得你的名字吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you remember your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.79,0:01:12.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:22.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我一起的那个男人 他也在这里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man I was with, is he here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时是一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:26.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们没有救你 你也会成为行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we hadn't saved you, you'd be one of them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:31.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你欠我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you owe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:23.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一周前 有些人出去找补给了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of them out there were on a run about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:25.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在卡车停靠站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found two boxes of Bisquick
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:27.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了两盒饼干粉和一盒梅尔·哈格德的磁带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a Merle Haggard tape at a truck stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:30.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在桥下发现了这位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then this gentleman under a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心搏停止 极度脱水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cardiac arrest and extreme dehydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:35.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to do what I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:42.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 就这样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:45.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果病人没有好转的迹象…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If patients don't show any signs of improvement...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:48.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩就会下命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Dawn calls it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:15.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 尸体要冷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, body's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:10.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有多少人住在这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many people live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚够让我们运转下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just enough to keep us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:14.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人一开始就在这里 有些人作为病人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us started here, some came as patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都有工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone has a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:17.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能埋了他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't we bury him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:20.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 有必要时我们才出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we only go out when we need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:22.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可能不是最庄严的尸体处理系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may not be the most dignified disposal system,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:25.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们只能凑合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we work with what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:29.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功保卫了楼梯井\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've managed to secure and guard the stairwells,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:31.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是一楼的窗户碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the windows are blown out on the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:34.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸们听到声音 就会进地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rotters find their way into the basement when they hear a noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果尸体足够温暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if the bodies are warm or warm enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:39.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会吃掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they clean up some of the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:41.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用一切可以用的资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use everything you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.09,0:04:42.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这是最快下去的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus it's the fastest way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你气色越来越好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时我们有了一些枪支的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a lead on some guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:11.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我和搭档去了很远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so me and my partner were pretty far out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:14.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候我们看见了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when we saw you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:16.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在路上爬着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wriggling in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得我了啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:22.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在跟一只行尸搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was fighting a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后一切都变黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then everything went black.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:29.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们出现时 有一只在盯着你的大腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, one was eyeing your thighs when we showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我先赶到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I got there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉了那只行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacked that rotter up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:35.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是戈尔曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人帮了你的忙时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When someone does you a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:41.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表示感谢是一种礼节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a courtesy to show some appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:45.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想让我写下你占用的一切资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you want me to write down everything you're taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:51.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都有所代价 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything costs something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到琼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:03.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前 你要洗衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until then, you've got laundry duty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:05.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我想要我的警服…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want my uniform washed ...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分开清洗 并且熨平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}separately and pressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:09.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聪明鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:26.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前感觉就像溺在研究的海洋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to feel like I was drowning in research.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:28.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这海洋枯竭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the oceans are dry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:31.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能在无聊中窒息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm suffocating in boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:37.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你都安逸到无聊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you feel safe enough to be bored,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:40.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就很幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:44.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是小金伯朗的歌 喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Junior Kimbrough. Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:49.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都想不起上一次听唱片是什么时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't remember the last time I heard a record.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是身为这里唯一的医生的少数好处之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of the few perks I get for being the only doctor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:58.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那个好处 还有这盘东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That and whatever this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小白鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:01.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃的那份呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:03.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿的越多 欠的越多 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more I take, the more I owe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃过小白鼠吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever tried guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:15.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃过就不会管这叫好处了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't call it a perk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:18.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用告诉道恩 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn doesn't have to know. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:43.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘鲁人喜欢吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good enough for Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是卡拉瓦乔的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Caravaggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:57.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在高级艺术博物馆外的街道上捡到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it on the street outside the High.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像垃圾一样丢在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:02.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它现在没有容身之所了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't have a place anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艺术的宗旨并非生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Art isn't about survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是超越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about transcendence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:13.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越动物本能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being more than animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:14.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,崛起立于高处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rising above.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:17.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再那样了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't do that anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:21.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:24.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在还在唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:31.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 又有新的伤员 - 找到了他的钱包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got a new one. - Found his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:32.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫加文·崔维特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Gavin Trevitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一楼的公寓摔下来 试图逃开几只行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fell from a first floor apartment trying to get away from some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:41.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他失了很多血 生命迹象在衰竭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lost a lot of blood and his vitals are dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:42.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他活不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he's gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们已经给他太多汽油了… - 交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've already given him gas... - I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:46.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你想救人 那就救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you wanted to save people, so save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:49.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道他的伤有多重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know the extent of his injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:50.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看 他已经不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this one's a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:51.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过你不想让我浪费资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you didn't want me wasting resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我想让你试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, today I want you to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:58.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 给心电图和超声波插上电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, plug the EKG and the ultrasound into that battery pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:09:00.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 很好 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Good. Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接在病人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now attach it to the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:13.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,张力性气胸 要穿肺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tension pneumothorax. Punctured lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:15.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝 给我从那柜子里拿一个空心针\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth, I need a large hollow needle in that cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:41.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能救活吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从楼上摔了下来 道恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fell from a building, Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:46.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能救活吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he going to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:49.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见这些淤青了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see these bruises?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:50.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是内出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has internal bleeding,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我需要分层扫描才能知道有多严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I need a CAT scan to know how bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我知道了出血程度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even if I could determine that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有能救他的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have the tools to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:59.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你了 这是浪费资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, this was a waste of resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:08.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,史蒂文 给我搞清楚局面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve, try to grasp the stakes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:25.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她总是这样吗 - 只有心情不好的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is she always like that? - Only on her bad days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:29.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是 她心情永远不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unfortunate for us that's the only kind she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:32.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚给你留了件新衬衫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah left you a new shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她爱干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She likes things neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她肯定喜欢你的办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must love your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:41.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都以不同的方式为她效力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all have ways of making her pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:44.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在门外等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wait for you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩叫你 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn needs you, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:16.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我们发现了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's lucky we found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:20.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你想做什么 都不值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you were thinking, it wasn't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:21.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你有两个选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you have two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么我们帮你截肢 要么你自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either we cut off your arm or you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:27.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的 还有你的小婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw you and your little bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:29.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 自以为是的荡妇 - 戈尔曼 出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Smart-ass whore. - Gorman, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是麻醉剂 你用得着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's anesthetic. You need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:42.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 去死吧 - 她已经做出选择了 快动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go to hell. - She made her choice. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:43.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:47.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! I said leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们绝不会见死不救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going to let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:50.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会眼睁睁地看你尸变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not going to let you turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我帮不上忙 - 你想让她死吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't help. - Do you want her to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝 帮我们压住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth, I need you to hold her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it now. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:03.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没事的 没事的 - 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay. It's okay. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:04.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:07.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会回他那儿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going back to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:08.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:11.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你控制不了他们 - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't control them. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:13.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝 准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:39.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是诺亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:42.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"棒棒糖协会"的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of the Lollipop Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:51.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得上午的事过后 你可以吃点糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figured you could use a pick-me-up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:52.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换换心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:56.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早知道我就把整罐糖都拿来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess I should have brought the whole jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件应该合身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, this should fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道琼是怎么回事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what happened with Joan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:11.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她留下来 工作了一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she'd have stayed, worked for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不能等康复了直接走吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}couldn't she have just left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:17.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我没见到过这种情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen it work like that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:19.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿工作多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:20.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多有1年吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess about a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:30.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我老爸被人发现的时候 都是奄奄一息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad and I were both pretty messed up when they found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:34.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说只能救活一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said that they could only save one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:36.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直被蒙在鼓里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the longest time, I actually believed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:39.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今才明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:44.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸要高大 强壮许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad was bigger, stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会反抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would have fought back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他们造成威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would have been a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:50.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们是故意不救他的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They left him behind on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:52.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩对这事睁一只眼闭一只眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Dawn just looked the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.03,0:13:56.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看似她在掌控全局 实则不然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, she's in charge, but just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况越来越糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:02.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以一旦时机成熟 我就要离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why I'm out of here when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:04.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找我的叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came looking for my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:07.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再接老妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta get back to my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:08.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你家在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里士满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:12.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗吉尼亚的首府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:15.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们那儿有高墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:18.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看我骨瘦如柴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, they think I'm scrawny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为我不堪一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:24.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其实他们一点也不了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they don't know shit about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:26.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不了解我是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:30.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不了解你是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:39.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏普德 你已经连值两班了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shepherd, you've already pulled a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在换我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:41.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:42.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:46.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你还没吃早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you didn't have breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:47.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是停战协议？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace treaty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不用吃很多的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会受你逼迫留很久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not staying any longer than you make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:13.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该把这看成坐牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you shouldn't see this as a sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:18.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你提供食物 衣服 保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm giving you food, clothes, protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西从来都不是免费的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When have those things ever been free?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:22.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没主动向你求助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never asked for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你确实需要我的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试着看看我们做的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to look at the good we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:35.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算很艰难 我们还是救了琼一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard as it was, we saved Joan's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:37.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救了崔维特一命 我们还救了你一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevitt's life. We saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我维持着这里的运转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm keeping all of us going here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是件小事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not a small thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:53.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们付出了很多才变成今天这样 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's taken a lot to get us here, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:56.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我相信灾变之前的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I believe that what we had before all of this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:57.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并未终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:00.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们最终得救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when we're finally rescued,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:02.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等噩梦结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when this nightmare ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会需要重建的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna need to rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会真的认为有人会来救我们吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't really think someone's coming for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:08.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有像我们一样的人存在 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's still people like us, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:11.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有试图维护世界 重建秩序的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People trying to keep the world alive, to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前 我们都得贡献一份力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until then, we all have to contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:17.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都得妥协让步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:19.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有得到 就要有回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we take, we give back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:21.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:26.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以继续回报你欠我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So keep working off what you owe
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:28.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你很快就可以离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'll be out of here in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 假如你想离开的话 - 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If that's what you want. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就得吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you have to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:36.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然的话 你会变得虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, you'll get weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:39.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能好起来 你会需要更多的治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't heal, you'll require more treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:41.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就不能工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you won't be able to do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:48.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你情非得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:54.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:27.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你唱得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去叫爱德华兹医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get Dr. Edwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:38.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可以控制他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她没有 因为这样更简单一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she doesn't because it's easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她是个懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because she's a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对你做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:08.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜当本人不用付出代价时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it's easy to make a deal with the devil
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:10.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能轻易地和恶魔做交易了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you're not the one paying the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西不见了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is yours, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.53,0:19:15.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,青苹果味的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sour apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:19.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和道恩从儿科那里找来的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the kind Dawn acquired from pediatrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:22.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以尝一尝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suppose you could have a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:24.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能不能想起来这个味儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if it rings any bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:27.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:31.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想确认一下我把这糖还对人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to be sure I'm returning this to its rightful owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:45.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:49.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好 很好 - 别烦她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right. That's right. - Leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这姑娘是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl should have been mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:57.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都不是你的 戈尔曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's yours, Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:19:58.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你认为你能让琼回到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you think you're getting Joan back...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:02.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让她回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm gonna get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:05.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为道恩会阻止我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think Dawn's gonna stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:08.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会阻止你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在替人出头吗 医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stepping up, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:16.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你生病的时候会怎么样呢 戈尔曼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens when you get sick, Gorman?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你伤口什么时候感染的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you get an infection?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:21.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你被咬时？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you get bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:26.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得会有医生治疗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's gonna be somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除你之外的医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody who ain't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:30.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈尔曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:37.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有人能顶替她掌管一切呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe somebody in charge who ain't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:54.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么留在这？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:56.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你随时可以走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could leave whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:58.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要留在这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:12.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到格拉迪纪念医院的一层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the ground floor of Grady Memorial Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.89,0:21:15.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:18.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这里不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要带我来这？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:22.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每当我开始想太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I start thinking about it too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就下来看看这幅场景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come down to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:42.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要带我来这？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:46.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你问我为什么要留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked why I stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:54.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:55.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你讲个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:09.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当灾变爆发的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When everything started,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:11.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩听命于一个叫汉森的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn reported to a guy named Hanson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:14.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被派来清空医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had orders to clear the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:16.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把大家转移到巴特勒公园去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and move everyone to Butler Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:20.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多在午夜时 我们听到飞机声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was close to midnight when we heard the jets,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:21.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆炸声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哭喊声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.02,0:22:27.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那时正在三楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.35,0:22:29.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩和汉森的小队正在进行最后的搜查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn and Hanson's teams were doing a final sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.34,0:22:31.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道情况不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we knew it was bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:33.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是来这里后 我们才知道到底有多糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just didn't know how bad till we came up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:35.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城市沦陷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city had fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.97,0:22:39.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们疏散的所有人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everyone we evacuated...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:44.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:49.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起初我们几乎足不出户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kept mostly to ourselves at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:51.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到食物吃光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till the food ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:56.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始每次派一些人出去搜寻补给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We started going out on runs, a few of us at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:22:59.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会看到需要帮助的人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd see people who needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:01.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在苦苦支撑 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barely holding on. But ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:04.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也自身难保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were barely holding on ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来 我实在无法视而不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Came a time I couldn't look away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:12.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了一个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.97,0:23:16.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的衣服被凝固汽油弹烧着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Napalm burns on his clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.98,0:23:18.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮肤被烧伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:22.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩说我们分不出资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn said we couldn't spare the resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们达成了一个协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we struck a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:26.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd use what I could to heal him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:30.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他必须通过劳动来回报我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he'd compensate us for those resources through service.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.49,0:23:34.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:39.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是问题所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:41.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们失去了很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:44.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.33,0:23:46.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汉森崩溃了 他做了几个决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hanson cracked. He made some calls
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:48.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害死了几个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that got people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:51.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩解决了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn took care of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.71,0:23:54.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她干掉了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.89,0:23:59.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她带领我们经历艰险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She saw us past it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.45,0:24:01.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们团结在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kept us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.37,0:24:04.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保证每个人都活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kept us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:08.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你管这样的日子叫活着吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call this living?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.42,0:24:13.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还在呼吸啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:17.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带来的那些病人 他们也还在呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patients we brought here, they're still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.20,0:24:19.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果在这些围墙外 孤立无援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside these walls, alone, unprotected,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.87,0:24:21.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们和我们都活不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'd be dead. We'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:26.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩在外面坚持不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not the ones who make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:30.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况虽然很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As bad as it gets,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.46,0:24:33.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这里至少比外面安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's still better than down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:39.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.63,0:24:42.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你顺便去看一下崔维特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you look in on Mr. Trevitt
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.89,0:24:43.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后今天就到此为止吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:45.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.17,0:24:48.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他病情稳定 还要注射75毫克氯氮平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's stable, due for another 75mg of Clozapine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.46,0:24:52.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我们从头来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tomorrow we'll start fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.24,0:24:53.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.62,0:25:30.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在忙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still at it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:42.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.98,0:25:44.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:47.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.41,0:25:51.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们对他做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.15,0:25:53.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.24,0:25:56.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前他很稳定 直到你俩与他独处一室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was fine until the two of you were alone with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:58.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.03,0:26:00.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我实话实说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:02.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个意外 贝丝出去拿纱布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an accident. Beth left to get some gauze.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:05.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在擦地 可能不小心拔掉了呼吸机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was mopping. I must have unplugged the ventilator somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.12,0:26:06.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 只停了一分钟而已 - 不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It only stopped for a minute. - But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.95,0:26:08.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我又插上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.42,0:26:10.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他带去我办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him to my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:14.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩 这只是个意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn, it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.72,0:26:16.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是个意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.01,0:26:17.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:21.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他突然开始抽搐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just... he just started seizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.16,0:26:22.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抽搐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:25.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给他注射了氯硝安定 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you gave him Clonazepam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.49,0:26:27.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,氯 氯氮平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cloz... Clozapine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.46,0:26:31.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的是氯氮平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said Clozapine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.64,0:26:37.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不是那样说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.10,0:26:39.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.68,0:26:41.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝 趁着崔维特先生的尸体还没冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth, we need to deal with Mr. Trevitt
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.79,0:26:42.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把他处理掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while he's still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.90,0:26:45.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.14,0:26:46.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求了 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.29,0:26:48.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 求了 - 我们阻止不了 你阻止不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please! - We can't... you can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:26:59.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我不知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think I didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.97,0:27:05.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.37,0:27:07.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是我最优秀的工人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably my best worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:10.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他说的呼吸机的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that story he told about the ventilator?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.40,0:27:13.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子不太会说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy's not much of a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.05,0:27:15.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你早就知道了 为什么你不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you knew, then why did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:18.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想那样做 但我必须如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to. I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.50,0:27:22.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个好人的无心之过差点把一切都毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good man's mistakes almost ended everything for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:24.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若让这样的事重演 那我就太该死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll be damned if I'm gonna let that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.05,0:27:32.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做出的牺牲都是为了大我的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every sacrifice we make needs to be for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.16,0:27:37.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦不是 一旦我们忽视了这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second it isn't, the second we lose sight of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:38.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切就都完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.78,0:27:47.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是 你并不属于大我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing is, you're not the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.03,0:27:51.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不够强壮 - 我很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not strong enough. - I am strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.55,0:27:54.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多少人需要冒着生命危险来救你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many people had to risk their lives to save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.25,0:27:57.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 你也是体制的一份子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here, you are part of a system.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.83,0:28:02.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受保护者们能让我的警官开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wards keep my officers happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.40,0:28:04.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的警官越是开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The happier my officers are,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.07,0:28:06.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就越会努力地帮助我们继续下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the harder they work to keep us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.94,0:28:10.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这并不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this hasn't been easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.99,0:28:14.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都做出了妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been compromises,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:16.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是确实管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.44,0:28:18.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们救了我们之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after they rescue us,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.85,0:28:21.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能让世界重建秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna help put the world back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:22.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们一直在坚持着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we're the ones holding on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:24.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们在这里做的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the good we're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.05,0:28:26.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是你要做的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the good you're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.45,0:28:29.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这才让你有所价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what makes you worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.94,0:28:32.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在外面…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.68,0:28:37.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你毫无价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:41.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么死 要么成为别人的负担\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except dead or somebody's burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.73,0:28:43.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 胡扯 - 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's bullshit. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.37,0:28:44.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来的那晚上我就看到了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw this the night you came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.41,0:28:47.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是胡扯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this bullshit, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.68,0:29:03.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的人注定不能接受这种生活 但没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people just aren't meant for this life, and that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:10.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他们不占那些能接受的人的便宜就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as they don't take advantage of the ones who are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看上去那么糟啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not as bad as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:26.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.94,0:29:28.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:31.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有止痛药 基本不疼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Painkillers. It barely even hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.60,0:29:36.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩需要崔维特来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn needed Trevitt for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.25,0:29:37.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那就是原因所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that's what that was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.68,0:29:41.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screwed-up thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.04,0:29:43.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's trapped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.66,0:29:45.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没被困住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:49.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.93,0:29:56.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从地下室出去最快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basement's the fastest way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.66,0:29:59.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但凡有一点动静 都会招来行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any noise and we got rotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.65,0:30:01.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就无声无息的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we won't make noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.41,0:30:03.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以盯着道恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can keep an eye on Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.07,0:30:07.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她办公室里有一把电梯组的备用钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She keeps a spare key to the elevator banks somewhere in her office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.75,0:30:09.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能找到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you can find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.44,0:30:13.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.94,0:32:20.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:25.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望没有打扰到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope I'm not interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.28,0:32:30.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩要我拿她的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn was just asking for her key.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:31.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was she, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.93,0:32:34.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚跟道恩在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I was just with Dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不记得她说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't seem to remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.29,0:32:40.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.73,0:32:43.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许不必让她知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe she doesn't have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:47.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还有别的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe there's another solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:48.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.76,0:32:52.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你我双赢的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little win-win for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.68,0:33:02.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 贝丝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how about it, Bethy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.57,0:33:05.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里解决好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gonna work something out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.35,0:33:08.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.14,0:33:14.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琼 她就不太配合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Joan, she's not such a team player.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.05,0:33:17.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我运气真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.78,0:33:21.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不怎么好斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're not a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.73,0:33:48.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能只是电池的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it may just be the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.42,0:33:50.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找个新的来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stop in and grab another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.17,0:33:52.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.76,0:33:55.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.50,0:34:00.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.91,0:34:05.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琼在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Joan was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.65,0:34:08.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到她和戈尔曼朝你办公室去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw her and Gorman headed towards your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.54,0:34:13.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:41.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.38,0:34:44.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:48.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你安全后 我爬下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you're safe, I'll climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.81,0:34:49.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.61,0:36:12.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:15.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚？诺亚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah? Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:44.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能走路吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.49,0:36:47.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 能 我没事 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I'm okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.35,0:37:00.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:21.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.13,0:39:01.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的以为自己是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.81,0:39:03.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他攻击了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.23,0:39:08.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像他攻击了琼一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like he attacked Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.20,0:39:12.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你放任他不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like you let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.31,0:39:14.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这里发生了什么 却放任不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what's happening here and you let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.87,0:39:16.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你任凭这一切发生 - 这是为了坚持下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're letting it happen. - So that we make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.94,0:39:19.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人会来救我们 道恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's coming, Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.93,0:39:23.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.25,0:39:30.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会死 而你白白任凭这一切发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna die and you let this happen for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.83,0:40:02.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愈合得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're healing quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.97,0:40:05.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再过几天就能继续工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should be ready to jump back into it in a couple more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.03,0:40:10.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样应该就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that should about do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.15,0:40:13.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道崔维特是医生的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know Trevitt was a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.03,0:40:18.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才让我给他打错了药 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you had me give him the wrong meds, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.36,0:40:20.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你借我的手杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you had me kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.91,0:40:26.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为如果他活下来 就会多一个医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if he had lived, there'd be another doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:28.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩就不需要你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Dawn wouldn't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.98,0:40:31.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不会再保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wouldn't protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.18,0:40:36.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,崔维特是圣依纳爵医院的肿瘤学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevitt was an oncologist at St. Ignatius.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.05,0:40:42.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.17,0:40:52.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会赶走我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would have kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.86,0:40:55.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈尔曼也许会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Gorman...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.51,0:40:59.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也许会杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe he would have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.98,0:41:03.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.98,0:41:05.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用一切可以用的资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use everything you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.20,0:41:11.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他们抓住耶稣时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they arrested Christ,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.10,0:41:14.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼得否认自己是门徒之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter denied being one of his disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.68,0:41:20.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.28,0:41:25.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则他们也会把他钉在十字架上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would have crucified him, too.
